[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 1: Use the formula for inradius and circumradius
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m In a triangle, the inradius $ r $ and circumradius $ R $ are related to the area $ \Delta $ and semiperimeter $ s $ as:
