[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 2: Use the Hyperbola Equation
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Since all points $A, B, C, D$ lie on the hyperbola, they must satisfy the hyperbola equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
