[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 4: Objective
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m We are to find the **greatest real number less than $BD^2$** for all such rhombi.
