[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 6: Use Symmetry and Parametrize the Hyperbola
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m We can parametrize the hyperbola:
