[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m > Find the sum of all integer bases $ b > 9 $ for which $ 17_b $ is a divisor of $ 97_b $.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 1: Understand the notation
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m In base $ b $, the number $ 17_b $ means:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 1 \cdot b + 7 = b + 7
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Similarly, $ 97_b $ means:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 9 \cdot b + 7 = 9b + 7
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m We are told that $ 17_b $ divides $ 97_b $, i.e.,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 9b + 7 \equiv 0 \pmod{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m So, we need:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 9b + 7 \equiv 0 \pmod{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 2: Simplify the congruence
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m We want:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 9b + 7 \equiv 0 \pmod{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Let’s rewrite the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 9b + 7 = 9(b + 7) - 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 9(b + 7) - 56 \equiv 0 \pmod{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m This implies:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m -56 \equiv 0 \pmod{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m \Rightarrow 56 \equiv 0 \pmod{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m \Rightarrow b + 7 \mid 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 3: Find all divisors of 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m We find all positive divisors of 56:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 1, 2, 4, 7, 8, 14, 28, 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Now, since $ b > 9 $, we consider only those divisors $ d $ such that $ d > 9 $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m d \in \{14, 28, 56\}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m So, possible values of $ b + 7 $ are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ b + 7 = 14 \Rightarrow b = 7 $ → **not valid** (since $ b > 9 $)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ b + 7 = 28 \Rightarrow b = 21 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ b + 7 = 56 \Rightarrow b = 49 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 4: Sum the valid values of $ b $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Valid values of $ b $ are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 21, 49
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m So the sum is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 21 + 49 = \boxed{70}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ---
