[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 1: Convert the numbers from base $ b $ to base 10
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Let’s convert the base-$ b $ numbers to base 10:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ 17_{b} = 1 \cdot b + 7 = b + 7 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ 97_{b} = 9 \cdot b + 7 = 9b + 7 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m We are told that $ 17_{b} $ divides $ 97_{b} $, i.e.:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m \frac{9b + 7}{b + 7} \text{ is an integer}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m So we want:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m \frac{9b + 7}{b + 7} \in \mathbb{Z}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 2: Simplify the expression
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Let’s simplify the fraction:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m \frac{9b + 7}{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m We can perform polynomial division or rewrite it as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m \frac{9b + 7}{b + 7} = \frac{9(b + 7) - 56}{b + 7} = 9 - \frac{56}{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m So the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 9 - \frac{56}{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m For this to be an integer, $ \frac{56}{b + 7} $ must also be an integer. That is, $ b + 7 $ must be a **divisor of 56**.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 3: Find all divisors of 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m We find all positive integer divisors of 56:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m \text{Divisors of 56: } 1, 2, 4, 7, 8, 14, 28, 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Now, since $ b > 9 $, we must have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m b + 7 > 9 \Rightarrow b > 2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m So we are looking for divisors of 56 that are **greater than 2** and such that:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m b + 7 = d \Rightarrow b = d - 7
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m We now list the valid $ d $ values (divisors of 56) that satisfy $ d > 2 $ and $ b > 9 $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ d = 8 \Rightarrow b = 1 $ → too small
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ d = 7 \Rightarrow b = 0 $ → too small
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ d = 14 \Rightarrow b = 7 $ → too small
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ d = 28 \Rightarrow b = 21 $ → valid
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ d = 56 \Rightarrow b = 49 $ → valid
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m So the valid values of $ b $ are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m b = 21, 49
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 4: Compute the sum of all such $ b $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 21 + 49 = 70
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
