[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 3: Use the Rhombus Property
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m In a rhombus:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - All sides are equal.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - The diagonals are perpendicular.
