[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m So, the vectors $\vec{AB}$ and $\vec{AD}$ must be perpendicular.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Let’s compute the vectors:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $\vec{AB} = (c - a, d - b)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $\vec{AD} = (-c - a, -d - b)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Their dot product must be zero:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m (c - a)(-c - a) + (d - b)(-d - b) = 0
