[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 5: Solve the System of Equations
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Let’s denote:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m x = a^2, \quad y = b^2, \quad u = c^2, \quad v = d^2
