[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m So, the **greatest real number less than** $BD^2$ is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m \boxed{80}
