[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m \frac{x^2}{20} - \frac{y^2}{24} = 1
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m and a **rhombus** $ABCD$ inscribed in this hyperbola, such that the **diagonals intersect at the origin** (i.e., the origin is the center of the rhombus).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
