[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 6: Use the formula for $IA$ and $OI$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Let’s use the following known results:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $IA = \sqrt{R^2 + r^2 - 2Rr \cos A}$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $OI = \sqrt{R^2 - 2Rr \cos A}$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Let’s denote $\cos A = x$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Then:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m IA = \sqrt{R^2 + r^2 - 2Rr x}
