[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m We are to find the **time** (in minutes) it takes her to walk **at speed $ s + \frac{1}{2} $ km/h**, **including** the $ t $ minutes spent in the coffee shop.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### **Step 1: Convert all times to hours**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - 4 hours = 4 hours
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - 2 hours and 24 minutes = 2 + $ \frac{24}{60} = 2.4 $ hours
