[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Again, convert to hours:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m t = \left(2.4 - \frac{9}{s + 2}\right) \times \frac{1}{60}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### **Step 4: Set the two expressions for $ t $ equal**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m From the first scenario:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m t = \left(4 - \frac{9}{s}\right) \times \frac{1}{60}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m From the second scenario:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m t = \left(2.4 - \frac{9}{s + 2}\right) \times \frac{1}{60}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Set them equal:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m \left(4 - \frac{9}{s}\right) \times \frac{1}{60} = \left(2.4 - \frac{9}{s + 2}\right) \times \frac{1}{60}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Multiply both sides by 60 to eliminate the denominator:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 4 - \frac{9}{s} = 2.4 - \frac{9}{s + 2}
