[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Subtract 2.4 from both sides:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 1.6 - \frac{9}{s} = -\frac{9}{s + 2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Multiply both sides by $ s(s + 2) $ to eliminate denominators:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
