[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m So, the diagonals of the rhombus are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $AC$ and $BD$, intersecting at the origin.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Let’s denote:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $A = (a, b)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $C = (-a, -b)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $B = (c, d)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $D = (-c, -d)$
