[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Then the diagonals are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $AC = \text{from } (a, b) \text{ to } (-a, -b)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $BD = \text{from } (c, d) \text{ to } (-c, -d)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m The **lengths** of the diagonals are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $AC = \sqrt{(2a)^2 + (2b)^2} = 2\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $BD = \sqrt{(2c)^2 + (2d)^2} = 2\sqrt{c^2 + d^2}$
