[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m So, the **area** of the rhombus is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m \text{Area} = \frac{1}{2} \cdot AC \cdot BD = \frac{1}{2} \cdot 2\sqrt{a^2 + b^2} \cdot 2\sqrt{c^2 + d^2} = 2\sqrt{(a^2 + b^2)(c^2 + d^2)}
