[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m We are to find the **time** it takes her to walk **at speed $ s + \frac{1}{2} $ km/h**, including the $ t $ minutes in the coffee shop.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### **Step 1: Convert all times to hours**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - 4 hours = 4 hours
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - 2 hours and 24 minutes = 2 + 24/60 = 2.4 hours
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### **Step 2: Set up equations**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Let’s denote:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ d = 9 $ km (distance)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ t $ minutes = $ \frac{t}{60} $ hours (convert to hours)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ s $ = speed in km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ s + 2 $ = speed in km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ s + \frac{1}{2} $ = speed in km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### **First scenario: Speed $ s $**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Time = $ \frac{d}{s} + \frac{t}{60} = 4 $ hours
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m \frac{9}{s} + \frac{t}{60} = 4 \quad \text{(1)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### **Second scenario: Speed $ s + 2 $**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Time = $ \frac{d}{s + 2} + \frac{t}{60} = 2.4 $ hours
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} + \frac{t}{60} = 2.4 \quad \text{(2)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
