[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 3: Solve the system of equations
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m We now have two equations:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 1. $ \frac{9}{s} + \frac{t}{60} = 4 $
