[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 3: Use the formula for inradius and circumradius
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m The inradius $r$ and circumradius $R$ are related to the sides of the triangle by:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m r = \frac{A}{s}, \quad R = \frac{abc}{4A}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Where:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $A$ is the area of the triangle,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $s = \frac{a + b + c}{2}$ is the semi-perimeter.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m r = \frac{A}{s} \Rightarrow A = rs = 6s
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m R = \frac{abc}{4A} = \frac{abc}{4 \cdot 6s} = \frac{abc}{24s}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m R = \frac{abc}{24s} \Rightarrow abc = 24Rs = 24 \cdot 13 \cdot s = 312s
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m But we also have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m A = rs = 6s
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m A = 6s, \quad abc = 312s
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Now, we can use the formula for the area in terms of the sides and the circumradius:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m A = \frac{abc}{4R} = \frac{312s}{4 \cdot 13} = \frac{312s}{52} = 6s
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
