[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ 7 - 7 = 0 $ → not valid
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ 8 - 7 = 1 $ → not valid
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ 14 - 7 = 7 $ → not valid
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ 28 - 7 = 21 $ → valid
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $ 56 - 7 = 49 $ → valid
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m So the valid values of $ b $ are:
