[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m So, the length of the side $BC = a = 4\sqrt{30}$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Now, we are to find $AB \cdot AC$.
