[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m We are given that the circumradius $R = 13$, and the inradius $r = 6$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m We can use the formula for the area of the triangle:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m \Delta = r \cdot s = 6 \cdot s
