[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 12\sqrt{30} + 3(b + c) = \frac{b c \sqrt{30}}{13}
