[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Now, we also know from the formula for the inradius:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m r = \frac{\Delta}{s} = \frac{\frac{b c \sqrt{30}}{13}}{\frac{4\sqrt{30} + b + c}{2}} = \frac{2 b c \sqrt{30}}{13(4\sqrt{30} + b + c)} = 6
