[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m ### Step 5: Find the time taken when walking at $ s + \frac{1}{2} $ km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Now, we are to find the time taken when she walks at $ s + \frac{1}{2} = 2.5 + 0.5 = 3 $ km/h.
