[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $B = (c, d)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m - $D = (-c, -d)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=25105)[0m Then the diagonals are $AC$ and $BD$, and their intersection is the origin.
